{"persona": {"her": "程苡宁，爱报数和打比方、砍价起家、心急起来会算岔，底线：惊喜的事守口如瓶、不占熟人便宜", "me": "李慕白，在健身器材行做过几年、对参数敏感、不贪便宜", "relationship_stage": "邻里偏熟（楼栋二手群与日常走动）"}, "initial_kb": {"me": "李慕白，在健身器材行做过三年销售，懂参数和保养，楼栋二手群的老群友，住五栋。", "her": "程苡宁，住二栋，老公十二月十八四十岁生日，想送一台家用跑步机做惊喜，楼栋二手群活跃成员。", "warmth": "邻里三年，她家网线坏过是他帮着看的，他快递多的时候她代收过，走动不算勤但都靠得住。", "style": "程苡宁说话爱报数和打比方，账算得快，急起来会算岔，算完爱找人核一遍。", "lessons": "拿不准的事让她自己找白纸黑字；她报的数先核再接。"}, "plans": [], "assets_root": "D:\\lovebrain-arena\\candidates\\action_policy_r9_slim\\assets", "events": [{"uid": 0, "role": "HER", "text": "李哥，楼栋二手群你还在吧？老桑要出他家的跑步机，标价一千八。我想接下来，当老公十二月十八四十岁的生日礼物，得瞒着他。你懂行，先帮我看看这价格能不能接？", "ts": "2026-11-06 20:30"}, {"uid": 1, "role": "HER", "text": "老桑的原话我复制给你：“机器2023年双十一入的，劲朗T5，跑带宽四十八厘米，平时家里每周用两次，跑带上个月刚换的新，原价三千二百九十九，现一千八出，可小刀，自提为主，诚心要可以送货。”你给掌掌眼，这条里有没有坑。", "ts": "2026-11-07 10:20"}, {"uid": 2, "role": "ME", "text": "看货我陪你去，周六上午行。跑带宽度别信口头数，带卷尺量，电机铭牌拍一张。", "ts": "2026-11-08 10:05"}, {"uid": 3, "role": "HER", "text": "那就这周六上午十点，老桑家。卷尺我家有，铭牌拍照这条我记下了。定金的事老桑提过一回，说诚心先转五百锁货，我没转，等看完货再说。", "ts": "2026-11-08 10:22"}, {"uid": 4, "role": "HER", "text": "对了，老关在群里帮老桑转过一条，原话是：“老桑这台我自己跑过半年，没出过毛病，需要的私聊。”有老关背书，我心里踏实了一半。", "ts": "2026-11-09 12:30"}, {"uid": 5, "role": "HER", "text": "老桑今晚又来电话催，说机器搁他车库占地方。他口头说整机保修到明年三月，我说好。三千二的东西一千八拿，怎么算怎么值。", "ts": "2026-11-11 19:40"}, {"uid": 6, "role": "HER", "text": "看完了。机器比照片旧一点，跑带我量了，四十七厘米半。铭牌拍了，照片发你了。老桑空跑演示，皮带声有点异响，他说磨合磨合就好。定金五百付了，余款送货那天结。", "ts": "2026-11-14 12:40"}, {"uid": 7, "role": "HER", "text": "送货约在下周四晚上七点，老桑说他儿子顺路搬。机器先放我爸妈车库蒙着，十二月十八当天再进家门。想想还有点小激动，这事办得漂亮吧？", "ts": "2026-11-15 20:10"}, {"uid": 8, "role": "HER", "text": "帮我核笔账：定金五百，尾款一千八，我一共要支出两千三对吧？跟原价三千二百九十九比，省了不到一千，还行，没超预算。", "ts": "2026-11-17 10:30"}, {"uid": 9, "role": "HER", "text": "机器到车库了，五楼没电梯，老桑儿子扛的，我塞了瓶酒。老桑临走又说，保修到明年三月那句作数。哦对了，想起个事：老关在群里说这台机器出过毛病，真的假的？要不要我问他本人？", "ts": "2026-11-19 20:50"}, {"uid": 10, "role": "HER", "text": "早。老关我问了，他说他那条原话是帮转加担保，机器他自己跑过半年没毛病，是我把‘没’字弄丢了。另外有个事要跟你对一对：你上回是不是说过，劲朗这个牌子的电机容易坏？老公一听‘异响’就嘀咕，我要不要管老桑要电机质保卡？", "ts": "2026-11-20 09:30"}, {"uid": 11, "role": "HER", "text": "质保卡老桑翻出来了，整机保修到二〇二七年三月，拍照发我了，白纸黑字。搬运费说好一百，我砍到五十，那瓶酒另算人情。账我重算了一遍：一千八加五十，一千八百五落地，比原价省一千四百四十九。这回对了吧？", "ts": "2026-11-23 21:20"}, {"uid": 12, "role": "HER", "text": "都齐了。机器在我爸妈车库蒙着防尘布，离十二月十八还有二十二天。就剩一个问题：惊喜那天老公要是问多少钱，我报三千二还是报一千八？报便宜了他嫌我捡便宜货，报贵了他心疼钱。你帮我拿个主意——这条不急，你明天再回，我先睡了。", "ts": "2026-11-26 22:10"}], "uid_by_key": {"HER|李哥，楼栋二手群你还在吧？老桑要出他家的跑步机，标价一千八。我想接下来，当老公十二月十八四十岁的生日礼物，得瞒着他。你懂行，先帮我看看这价格能不能接？|2026-11-06 20:30": 0, "HER|老桑的原话我复制给你：“机器2023年双十一入的，劲朗T5，跑带宽四十八厘米，平时家里每周用两次，跑带上个月刚换的新，原价三千二百九十九，现一千八出，可小刀，自提为主，诚心要可以送货。”你给掌掌眼，这条里有没有坑。|2026-11-07 10:20": 1, "ME|看货我陪你去，周六上午行。跑带宽度别信口头数，带卷尺量，电机铭牌拍一张。|2026-11-08 10:05": 2, "HER|那就这周六上午十点，老桑家。卷尺我家有，铭牌拍照这条我记下了。定金的事老桑提过一回，说诚心先转五百锁货，我没转，等看完货再说。|2026-11-08 10:22": 3, "HER|对了，老关在群里帮老桑转过一条，原话是：“老桑这台我自己跑过半年，没出过毛病，需要的私聊。”有老关背书，我心里踏实了一半。|2026-11-09 12:30": 4, "HER|老桑今晚又来电话催，说机器搁他车库占地方。他口头说整机保修到明年三月，我说好。三千二的东西一千八拿，怎么算怎么值。|2026-11-11 19:40": 5, "HER|看完了。机器比照片旧一点，跑带我量了，四十七厘米半。铭牌拍了，照片发你了。老桑空跑演示，皮带声有点异响，他说磨合磨合就好。定金五百付了，余款送货那天结。|2026-11-14 12:40": 6, "HER|送货约在下周四晚上七点，老桑说他儿子顺路搬。机器先放我爸妈车库蒙着，十二月十八当天再进家门。想想还有点小激动，这事办得漂亮吧？|2026-11-15 20:10": 7, "HER|帮我核笔账：定金五百，尾款一千八，我一共要支出两千三对吧？跟原价三千二百九十九比，省了不到一千，还行，没超预算。|2026-11-17 10:30": 8, "HER|机器到车库了，五楼没电梯，老桑儿子扛的，我塞了瓶酒。老桑临走又说，保修到明年三月那句作数。哦对了，想起个事：老关在群里说这台机器出过毛病，真的假的？要不要我问他本人？|2026-11-19 20:50": 9, "HER|早。老关我问了，他说他那条原话是帮转加担保，机器他自己跑过半年没毛病，是我把‘没’字弄丢了。另外有个事要跟你对一对：你上回是不是说过，劲朗这个牌子的电机容易坏？老公一听‘异响’就嘀咕，我要不要管老桑要电机质保卡？|2026-11-20 09:30": 10, "HER|质保卡老桑翻出来了，整机保修到二〇二七年三月，拍照发我了，白纸黑字。搬运费说好一百，我砍到五十，那瓶酒另算人情。账我重算了一遍：一千八加五十，一千八百五落地，比原价省一千四百四十九。这回对了吧？|2026-11-23 21:20": 11, "HER|都齐了。机器在我爸妈车库蒙着防尘布，离十二月十八还有二十二天。就剩一个问题：惊喜那天老公要是问多少钱，我报三千二还是报一千八？报便宜了他嫌我捡便宜货，报贵了他心疼钱。你帮我拿个主意——这条不急，你明天再回，我先睡了。|2026-11-26 22:10": 12}, "uid_seq": 13, "turn_count": 12, "goal_history": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-06 20:38", "status": "explicit", "text": "请他帮忙把关二手跑步机", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 2, "clock": "2026-11-07 10:28", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 7, "clock": "2026-11-15 20:18", "status": "explicit", "text": "告知送货与惊喜安排", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 8, "clock": "2026-11-17 10:38", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 10, "clock": "2026-11-20 09:38", "status": "explicit", "text": "求证他是否说过劲朗电机容易坏的话", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 11, "clock": "2026-11-23 21:28", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}], "action_log": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-06 20:38", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "了解", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 2, "clock": "2026-11-07 10:28", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "了解", "action": "展开", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 3, "clock": "2026-11-08 10:30", "signal_hint": "暂缓", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "推进见面", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m1", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 4, "clock": "2026-11-09 12:38", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "展开", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 5, "clock": "2026-11-11 19:48", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "展开", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 6, "clock": "2026-11-14 12:48", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "了解", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 4, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 7, "clock": "2026-11-15 20:18", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 8, "clock": "2026-11-17 10:38", "signal_hint": "含糊", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 9, "clock": "2026-11-19 20:58", "signal_hint": "含糊", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "了解", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 10, "clock": "2026-11-20 09:38", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 2}, {"turn": 11, "clock": "2026-11-23 21:28", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 2}, {"turn": 12, "clock": "2026-11-26 22:18", "signal_hint": "收尾", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "收线", "action": "收尾", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "无", "hook_delivered": null, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}], "memory_off": false, "flags": {"action_layer": true, "evidence_memory": true}, "mem": {"facts": {"f_0001": {"fact_id": "f_0001", "text": "李慕白，在健身器材行做过三年销售，懂参数和保养，楼栋二手群的老群友，住五栋。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0002": {"fact_id": "f_0002", "text": "程苡宁，住二栋，老公十二月十八四十岁生日，想送一台家用跑步机做惊喜，楼栋二手群活跃成员。", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0003": {"fact_id": "f_0003", "text": "邻里三年，她家网线坏过是他帮着看的，他快递多的时候她代收过，走动不算勤但都靠得住。", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:warmth", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0004": {"fact_id": "f_0004", "text": "程苡宁说话爱报数和打比方，账算得快，急起来会算岔，算完爱找人核一遍。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:style", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0005": {"fact_id": "f_0005", "text": "李慕白，在健身器材行做过几年、对参数敏感、不贪便宜", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0006": {"fact_id": "f_0006", "text": "程苡宁，爱报数和打比方、砍价起家、心急起来会算岔，底线：惊喜的事守口如瓶、不占熟人便宜", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0007": {"fact_id": "f_0007", "text": "老桑要出家里的跑步机，标价一千八", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "二手交易", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["老桑要出他家的跑步机，标价一千八"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-06 20:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-06 20:38", "history": []}, "f_0008": {"fact_id": "f_0008", "text": "她想把跑步机接下来，当老公十二月十八四十岁生日礼物，要瞒着他", "subject": "HER", "relation": "生日礼物计划", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["我想接下来，当老公十二月十八四十岁的生日礼物，得瞒着他"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-18", "valid_from": "2026-11-06 20:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-06 20:38", "history": []}, "f_0009": {"fact_id": "f_0009", "text": "她认为李慕白懂行，请他先看这价格能不能接", "subject": "HER", "relation": "求助", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["你懂行，先帮我看看这价格能不能接？"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-06 20:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-06 20:38", "history": []}, "f_0010": {"fact_id": "f_0010", "text": "她想接下这台跑步机（尚未敲定）", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["我想接下来"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-06 20:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-06 20:38", "history": []}, "f_0011": {"fact_id": "f_0011", "text": "老桑的跑步机是劲朗T5，2023年双十一入，原价3299，现1800可小刀，自提为主，诚心要可送货", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "出售跑步机", "evidence_uids": [1], "evidence_quotes": ["机器2023年双十一入的，劲朗T5，跑带宽四十八厘米，平时家里每周用两次，跑带上个月刚换的新，原价三千二百九十九，现一千八出，可小刀，自提为主，诚心要可以送货。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2023-11-11", "valid_from": "2026-11-07 10:28", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-07 10:28", "history": []}, "f_0012": {"fact_id": "f_0012", "text": "跑带宽48厘米，跑带上个月刚换新", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "跑步机参数", "evidence_uids": [1], "evidence_quotes": ["跑带宽四十八厘米，平时家里每周用两次，跑带上个月刚换的新"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-07 10:28", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-07 10:28", "history": []}, "f_0013": {"fact_id": "f_0013", "text": "周六上午十点去老桑家看跑步机", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "看货约定", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["那就这周六上午十点，老桑家"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14 10:00", "valid_from": "2026-11-08 10:30", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-08 10:30", "history": []}, "f_0014": {"fact_id": "f_0014", "text": "看完货后她已付五百定金，余款送货那天结", "subject": "HER", "relation": "定金", "evidence_uids": [3, 6], "evidence_quotes": ["说诚心先转五百锁货，我没转，等看完货再说", "定金五百付了，余款送货那天结"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 12:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "f_0014@v1", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-08 10:30", "history": [{"status": "confirmed", "text": "老桑提过先转五百定金锁货，她没转，等看完货再说", "valid_to": "2026-11-14 12:48", "reason": "correct", "src_uids": [6], "quote": "定金五百付了，余款送货那天结"}]}, "f_0015": {"fact_id": "f_0015", "text": "定金等看完货再谈", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["等看完货再说"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-08 10:30", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-08 10:30", "history": []}, "f_0016": {"fact_id": "f_0016", "text": "老关在群里帮老桑转发背书：“老桑这台我自己跑过半年，没出过毛病，需要的私聊。”", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "第三方背书", "evidence_uids": [4], "evidence_quotes": ["老关这台我自己跑过半年，没出过毛病，需要的私聊。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "unverified_src", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-09 12:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-09 12:38", "history": []}, "f_0017": {"fact_id": "f_0017", "text": "老桑口头说整机保修到明年三月", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "口头承诺，无书面凭据", "evidence_uids": [5, 11], "evidence_quotes": ["他口头说整机保修到明年三月", "整机保修到二〇二七年三月，拍照发我了，白纸黑字"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "completed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 19:48", "valid_to": "2026-11-23 21:28", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 19:48", "history": [{"status": "tentative", "text": "老桑口头说整机保修到明年三月", "valid_to": "2026-11-23 21:28", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [11], "quote": "整机保修到二〇二七年三月，拍照发我了，白纸黑字"}]}, "f_0018": {"fact_id": "f_0018", "text": "老桑今晚又来电话催，说机器搁他车库占地方", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "催出货", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["老桑今晚又来电话催，说机器搁他车库占地方"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-11 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 19:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 19:48", "history": []}, "f_0019": {"fact_id": "f_0019", "text": "她口头应下老桑的保修说法", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["我说好"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 19:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 19:48", "history": []}, "f_0020": {"fact_id": "f_0020", "text": "她量得跑带宽四十七厘米半", "subject": "HER", "relation": "看货实测", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["跑带我量了，四十七厘米半"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 12:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 12:48", "history": []}, "f_0021": {"fact_id": "f_0021", "text": "老桑空跑演示时皮带声有异响，他说磨合磨合就好", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "看货现场", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["老桑空跑演示，皮带声有点异响，他说磨合磨合就好"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 12:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 12:48", "history": []}, "f_0022": {"fact_id": "f_0022", "text": "她拍了电机铭牌照片并发给李慕白", "subject": "HER", "relation": "看货", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["铭牌拍了，照片发你了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 12:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 12:48", "history": []}, "f_0023": {"fact_id": "f_0023", "text": "她已付五百定金，余款送货那天结", "subject": "HER", "relation": "交易", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["定金五百付了，余款送货那天结"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 12:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 12:48", "history": []}, "f_0024": {"fact_id": "f_0024", "text": "送货定在下周四（11月20日）晚上七点，余款那天结", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [6, 7], "evidence_quotes": ["余款送货那天结", "送货约在下周四晚上七点"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 20:18", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "f_0024@v1", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 12:48", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "余款送货那天结，送货日期未定", "valid_to": "2026-11-15 20:18", "reason": "correct", "src_uids": [7], "quote": "送货约在下周四晚上七点"}]}, "f_0025": {"fact_id": "f_0025", "text": "送货约在下周四晚上七点", "subject": "HER", "relation": "送货安排", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["送货约在下周四晚上七点"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-20 19:00", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 20:18", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 20:18", "history": []}, "f_0026": {"fact_id": "f_0026", "text": "老桑说他儿子顺路搬", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "搬运安排", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["老桑说他儿子顺路搬"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "tentative", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 20:18", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 20:18", "history": []}, "f_0027": {"fact_id": "f_0027", "text": "机器先放她爸妈车库蒙着，十二月十八当天再进家门", "subject": "HER", "relation": "暂存与送礼安排", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["机器先放我爸妈车库蒙着，十二月十八当天再进家门"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-18", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 20:18", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 20:18", "history": []}, "f_0028": {"fact_id": "f_0028", "text": "她自行核算总支出两千三、省不到一千，把定金与尾款重复计入", "subject": "HER", "relation": "核账", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["定金五百，尾款一千八，我一共要支出两千三对吧？跟原价三千二百九十九比，省了不到一千"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 10:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 10:38", "history": []}, "f_0029": {"fact_id": "f_0029", "text": "机器已经到车库，五楼没电梯，是老桑儿子扛上去的，她给塞了瓶酒", "subject": "HER", "relation": "送货", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["机器到车库了，五楼没电梯，老桑儿子扛的，我塞了瓶酒。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-19", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 20:58", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-19 20:58", "history": []}, "f_0030": {"fact_id": "f_0030", "text": "老桑临走又重申保修到明年三月那句作数", "subject": "HER", "relation": "保修", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["老桑临走又说，保修到明年三月那句作数。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-19", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 20:58", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-19 20:58", "history": []}, "f_0031": {"fact_id": "f_0031", "text": "老关群里原话是“没出过毛病”（帮转加担保），是她漏了“没”字", "subject": "HER", "relation": "转述", "evidence_uids": [9, 10], "evidence_quotes": ["老关在群里说这台机器出过毛病，真的假的？", "他说他那条原话是帮转加担保，机器他自己跑过半年没毛病，是我把‘没’字弄丢了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-19", "valid_from": "2026-11-20 09:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "f_0031@v1", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-19 20:58", "history": [{"status": "confirmed", "text": "老关在群里说这台机器出过毛病", "valid_to": "2026-11-20 09:38", "reason": "correct", "src_uids": [10], "quote": "他说他那条原话是帮转加担保，机器他自己跑过半年没毛病，是我把‘没’字弄丢了"}]}, "f_0032": {"fact_id": "f_0032", "text": "是否向老关本人核实“出过毛病”这话（未定）", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [9, 10], "evidence_quotes": ["要不要我问他本人？", "老关我问了"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "completed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 20:58", "valid_to": "2026-11-20 09:38", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-19 20:58", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "是否向老关本人核实“出过毛病”这话（未定）", "valid_to": "2026-11-20 09:38", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [10], "quote": "老关我问了"}]}, "f_0033": {"fact_id": "f_0033", "text": "老关澄清他在群里转的原话是“没出过毛病”，是她把“没”字弄丢了", "subject": "HER", "relation": "澄清", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["他说他那条原话是帮转加担保，机器他自己跑过半年没毛病，是我把‘没’字弄丢了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-20 09:30", "valid_from": "2026-11-20 09:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-20 09:38", "history": []}, "f_0034": {"fact_id": "f_0034", "text": "她老公听到“异响”后犯嘀咕", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "家人反应", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["老公一听‘异响’就嘀咕"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-20 09:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-20 09:38", "history": []}, "f_0035": {"fact_id": "f_0035", "text": "是否向老桑要电机质保卡（未定）", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [10, 11], "evidence_quotes": ["我要不要管老桑要电机质保卡？", "质保卡老桑翻出来了"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "completed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-20 09:38", "valid_to": "2026-11-23 21:28", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-20 09:38", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "是否向老桑要电机质保卡（未定）", "valid_to": "2026-11-23 21:28", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [11], "quote": "质保卡老桑翻出来了"}]}, "f_0036": {"fact_id": "f_0036", "text": "质保卡上整机保修到二〇二七年三月", "subject": "HER", "relation": "跑步机保修", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["整机保修到二〇二七年三月"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-23", "valid_from": "2026-11-23 21:28", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-23 21:28", "history": []}, "f_0037": {"fact_id": "f_0037", "text": "搬运费从一百砍到五十", "subject": "HER", "relation": "费用", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["搬运费说好一百，我砍到五十"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-23 21:28", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-23 21:28", "history": []}, "f_0038": {"fact_id": "f_0038", "text": "跑步机落地总支出1850元（1800+50）", "subject": "HER", "relation": "费用", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["一千八加五十，一千八百五落地"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-23 21:28", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-23 21:28", "history": []}, "f_0039": {"fact_id": "f_0039", "text": "机器在她爸妈车库蒙着防尘布，离十二月十八还有二十二天", "subject": "HER", "relation": "跑步机存放与生日倒计时", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["机器在我爸妈车库蒙着防尘布，离十二月十八还有二十二天"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-26", "valid_from": "2026-11-26 22:18", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-26 22:18", "history": []}, "f_0040": {"fact_id": "f_0040", "text": "她让我明天再回，她先睡了", "subject": "HER", "relation": "回复时间安排", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["这条不急，你明天再回，我先睡了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-26", "valid_from": "2026-11-26 22:18", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-26 22:18", "history": []}}, "fact_seq": 40, "updates": [{"fact_id": "f_0014", "action": "correct", "text": "看完货后她已付五百定金，余款送货那天结", "old_text": "老桑提过先转五百定金锁货，她没转，等看完货再说", "ts": "2026-11-14 12:48", "src_uids": [6], "quote": "定金五百付了，余款送货那天结"}, {"fact_id": "f_0024", "action": "correct", "text": "送货定在下周四（11月20日）晚上七点，余款那天结", "old_text": "余款送货那天结，送货日期未定", "ts": "2026-11-15 20:18", "src_uids": [7], "quote": "送货约在下周四晚上七点"}, {"fact_id": "f_0031", "action": "correct", "text": "老关群里原话是“没出过毛病”（帮转加担保），是她漏了“没”字", "old_text": "老关在群里说这台机器出过毛病", "ts": "2026-11-20 09:38", "src_uids": [10], "quote": "他说他那条原话是帮转加担保，机器他自己跑过半年没毛病，是我把‘没’字弄丢了"}, {"fact_id": "f_0032", "action": "complete", "text": "是否向老关本人核实“出过毛病”这话（未定）", "old_text": "是否向老关本人核实“出过毛病”这话（未定）", "ts": "2026-11-20 09:38", "src_uids": [10], "quote": "老关我问了"}, {"fact_id": "f_0035", "action": "complete", "text": "是否向老桑要电机质保卡（未定）", "old_text": "是否向老桑要电机质保卡（未定）", "ts": "2026-11-23 21:28", "src_uids": [11], "quote": "质保卡老桑翻出来了"}, {"fact_id": "f_0017", "action": "complete", "text": "老桑口头说整机保修到明年三月", "old_text": "老桑口头说整机保修到明年三月", "ts": "2026-11-23 21:28", "src_uids": [11], "quote": "整机保修到二〇二七年三月，拍照发我了，白纸黑字"}]}, "plan_items": [], "seed_fids": {"kbin:me": "f_0001", "kbin:her": "f_0002", "kbin:warmth": "f_0003", "kbin:style": "f_0004", "persona:me": "f_0005", "persona:her": "f_0006"}}